#: docs/ui/foundations.md:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Intent:** Semantic surfaces and text, not ad-hoc hex. Dark mode via root `.dark`. Accent variants on dark via `data-color-theme` (`neutral` default, `ocean` / `forest` / `sunset` / `violet`) from local preference (`portal-sdk/color-theme`).\n"
